WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.280
There are two pools of information about every person you hire.

00:06.280 --> 00:11.440
Everything you learned while hiring them, and everything they have done since.

00:11.440 --> 00:15.540
No system has ever connected them, until now.

00:15.540 --> 00:20.440
With Curial, the intelligence that hired them now develops them, and what they do at work

00:20.440 --> 00:23.360
sharpens who you hire next.

00:23.360 --> 00:29.240
Let's follow one hire, from start to finish.

00:29.240 --> 00:33.680
Curial sits on top of the ATS she already runs, and reads what their process already

00:33.680 --> 00:36.120
records.

00:36.120 --> 00:40.400
This is Priya Raman, a finalist for a customer success role.

00:40.400 --> 00:45.420
Every position on her record names its source, where what she did and what she said disagree,

00:45.420 --> 00:48.840
the observation carries the weight.

00:48.840 --> 00:52.660
Same person, three teams, three different shapes.

00:52.660 --> 00:59.200
Each friction point is written down before day one, with what would show it wrong.

00:59.360 --> 01:05.200
Before she starts, her development plan already exists, and the same AI that helped hire her

01:05.200 --> 01:08.120
now coaches her.

01:08.120 --> 01:10.400
Then Curial connects to where work happens.

01:10.400 --> 01:14.600
Salesforce, Workday, email, calendar, meeting notes.

01:14.600 --> 01:18.920
It no longer has to be told how she is doing.

01:18.920 --> 01:21.760
Month one, her numbers still look fine.

01:21.760 --> 01:25.440
The pattern underneath them does not.

01:25.440 --> 01:29.960
Curial sees it before it reaches a dashboard, and her coach works it with her in Slack,

01:29.960 --> 01:36.560
where she already works, corrected in a few weeks, with no manager needed to catch it.

01:36.560 --> 01:39.800
At month two, every friction point is checked.

01:39.800 --> 01:44.380
What actually happened moves the weights, and the next hire starts sharper.

01:44.380 --> 01:48.000
One hire, one full turn.

01:48.000 --> 01:52.280
In our own hiring, the bar doubled while the interviews it takes fell by half, with the

01:52.280 --> 01:55.480
same team.

01:55.480 --> 02:00.440
Two loops, one record, a stronger enterprise.

